  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 with imagenet_vit_l and transformer aggregation (e.g., config_006) achieve high accuracy (0.7249). This experiment tests pca_n2000 (a less complex RNA encoder) with the same image encoder and aggregation to determine if it can match or exceed this performance. It clarifies the impact of RNA encoder choice while maintaining the proven-effective image and aggregation settings. The expected cost is similar to config_006 (3.60 GPU hours), balancing accuracy pursuit with budget constraints."
